# What a lead branch in the code repo may change (crew plan new <slug> --code): its shared docs. One
# glob per line, where a * also matches "/". crew plan check (which crew pr runs) and the code repo's
# pre-commit hook read this file from this repo's main, so a lead branch can't widen its own list.
# This repo needs no list: everything in it is the lead's.
#
# Code, card data and CI aren't here: they change through a task card, or by the human.

# The rules, the protocol, the decisions, the architecture, the conventions and the art
docs/**

# The pitch, the guide for anyone working on the code, and its permission rules
README.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/settings.json

# Stale docs in a package (only when no running task's scope has the file; crew plan check warns)
packages/*/README.md
apps/*/README.md
tools/*/README.md
